WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,860
Didn’t I ask you to stay in a hotel?

2
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:07,860
Why are you still sleeping here?

3
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:08,860
I gotta stick around

4
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,060
You can also rest here

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,860
This is where you find a place to stay, isn't it? It's nice here

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:14,260
You Chen Yundong

7
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,260
You are sincerely trying to make things difficult for me, right?

8
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,860
Then why are you sleeping here?

9
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:18,860
To disgust me?

10
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:19,860
make me feel guilty for you

11
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:22,660
Or to show my meanness and your pity? You think too much.

12
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,660
Then give me an explanation

13
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:27,060
Okay, I'll give you an explanation. I promised your dad

14
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,260
Always protect your safety

15
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,460
This is the promise I made to your dad. I have to do it.

16
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:31,860
And you are right

17
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,060
You live here as a woman

18
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,660
It would be inappropriate for me to live there too.

19
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,260
At the very least it will cause you psychological distress

20
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,460
Affect your normal life

21
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:41,340
So you choose to sleep here. It's fine here.

22
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,540
Is there something wrong with you?

23
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:44,740
They all sleep on the floor, which is fine for me.

24
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,940
This is already a good place

25
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,940
Okay, it's midnight. Go to sleep.

26
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,340
Do you think I can still sleep?

27
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:51,090
Even if I hate you again

28
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:52,090
I can't help but watch

29
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:53,090
Watching you sleeping on the floor

30
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:55,980
I just can't figure it out

31
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:58,780
I've told you what's wrong with letting you stay in a hotel.

32
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:00,780
Just come over tomorrow morning. I won't run away.

33
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:02,440
My dad asked you to follow me all the time

34
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:03,640
You really follow me all the time

35
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:05,640
Even if you want to sleep on the floor at night, you have to watch it

36
00:01:06,370 --> 00:01:08,770
Do you have a weak brain? Why are you so rigid?
